 Firmware files from linux-firmware, unchanged. Each is distributed under
 its maker's own licence, which allows redistribution; none is free
 software. /usr/lib/firmware/WHENCE (linux-firmware's own list) says which
 licence covers which file, and the licence texts it names are in
 /usr/lib/firmware/LICENSES. The linux-firmware commit the files were
 taken from is in /usr/lib/firmware/LICENSES/SOURCE.
